sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant Ag as Agent loop
    participant M as Model
    participant MCP as MCP server
    participant Tool as External system
    U->>Ag: a goal, not a single question
    loop until done or budget spent
        Ag->>M: context + the tools available
        M-->>Ag: either an answer, or a tool call
        alt tool call
            Ag->>MCP: invoke with the model's arguments
            MCP->>Tool: perform it
            Tool-->>MCP: result
            MCP-->>Ag: structured result
            Ag->>Ag: append to context and loop
        else answer
            Ag-->>U: final response
        end
    end
    Note over Ag,M: the model chooses, the loop executes — the model never touches the system directly
